<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμᾰτηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, όν </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ός</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Or.</u>
			962
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bloodstained</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖπες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					975
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					625
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα</span>
			<i>bloodshot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				381
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὸξ αἱματηρὰ κἀπὸ .
			.δρυός</span>, i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ αἵματος καὶ
				δρυός</span>, <i>fed by the blood of the victim</i> and
			the wood, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				766
			</span></i>: esp. <i>bloody, murderous</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα</span> A <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				137
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῦχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					815
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηγάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					859
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμμάτων διαφθοραί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					552
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόνος</span>
			<i>caused by the blood-reeking wound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				694
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of blood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1067
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταγόνες</span> gouts <i>of
			blood</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1415
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ. ῥοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					502
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ. φλέβες</span>
			<i>conueying blood</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				8.7
			</span></i>.</div>
